# Budget baseline: estimated tokens (runes/4, as oh bundle show --budget).
# prompt = composed system prompt; inlined = part taken by the inlined skills (count);
# catalog = on-demand skills visible to the agent and their catalogue entries (id: description).
# reach = on-demand skills the agent can reach (native skills, skills named in its prompt, stack
# skills for the agents with stack_skills, extra and prompt skills for the entry agent, skills
# named by its callers for the agents with skills_from_callers, their requires closure, then the
# skills named by the on-demand skills reached, transitively) and their catalogue entries.
# Per-agent catalogue (L2): catalog = reach.
# TOTAL: sums of the agents; catalog = every skill of the bundle; reach = skills reached by an agent.
# Regenerate: go test ./internal/bundle -run TestBudgetBaseline -update

